{"product_id":"the-butterfly-lion","title":"The Butterfly Lion","description":"\u003cp\u003eILLUSTRATED BY CHRISTIAN BIRMINGHAM. A lyrical and moving tale of a young boy growing up in Africa, and his lifelong friendship with a white lion. \"All my life I'll think you you, I promise I will. I won't ever forget you.\" Bertie rescues an orphaned white lion cub from the African veld. They are inseparable until Bertie is sent to boarding school far away in England and the lion is sold to a circus. Bertie swears that one day they will see one another again, but it is the butterfly lion which ensures that their friendship will never be forgotten. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:128 x 194  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Michael Morpurgo \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780006751038 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43656321990809,"sku":"14RE9780006751038","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/1ae89c4133181e3d32e51052ec8ad2ca.jpg?v=1702129349","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-butterfly-lion","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}